e_name": "Pythagoras_02.png", "id": "1521857538609718", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65402154_1521857545276384_6932935515601424484_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g3oPxGcMfnwQ7kNvwFnlg79&_nc_oc=AdpQmgPp9LHDxy-2sAnmlflTIoAq5Av8cqzzFaKjzyJ6zW0yvg51joYUrJLsipN84Ts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSysGCAjRudzz8J7L-phK420J8orO5CHjmHZnuK_F6nbA&oe=6B01BB1C"}, {"file_name": "Levy_02.png", "id": "196149426884252", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997710_196149430217585_1332548403471429223_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6rGlMApwvCAQ7kNvwHcMzqx&_nc_oc=Adpu0NeRRDNsaM8yzVgKReKGghCgUcNUxwZWPsyiCllQJX6MEWpuxdQJeaYmK3phY94&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTX3nX7odB6k22GNta6Eo1vIB2X1HzUksinnHjN8ba4HQ&oe=6B01E21B"}, {"file_name": "Radial_Solid.png", "id": "271501478838543", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031373_271501482171876_8031340628965781426_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e2ZqbYLWBLkQ7kNvwFnCxhY&_nc_oc=Adrhv5Zlcotcsbmo4Sh5N9AickF3gXw16173hB7038xoay0P3Kh_6KTmAnApQLe0wd4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRjLGvVJMiFU9w4PGFL66ABH9QI-xT_1D6KIS5kBhHAlA&oe=6B01DC5B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Psydmind_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1020482742612505", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982514_1020482745945838_6452784102981224285_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z86mljUOrMkQ7kNvwFCMUUE&_nc_oc=Adr-n_zRqChNSezV7_Q5vnWyFt50sAZdrfd6RNr4jbbd6wnkVws2TTswhwD4OQnJTj4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSckWpJt-PKHwOSpEbRTwDGZC90Oh6vuGLhcpWx0gL-Ig&oe=6B01BB9B"}, "display_name": "VoctoR PsydMind", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience the transformative power of VR meditation with PsydMind, your personal gateway to inner peace and well-being.\n\nPsydMind offers a powerful approach to meditation: \nFive distinct categories: Each scene is designed to address a specific mental health concern, incorporating elements of color theory, math, and shape theory to optimize your experience.\nGenerative art: Witness the mesmerizing beauty of evolving fractal landscapes, created through generative art, adding a dynamic and captivating element to your meditation practice.\nObject movement with binaural beats: Harmonize your brainwaves with the gentle movement of objects and the soothing sounds of binaural beats, promoting a deeper state of relaxation and focus.\n\nData collection and analysis: Gain insights into your progress and identify areas for improvement through anonymous data collection and analysis.\nBinaural beats: Incorporating beats with the moving objects could further promote relaxation and focus, aligning with the user's desired mental state.\nMusic: Carefully selected music can complement the visuals and binaural beats, creating a harmonious and immersive experience.\n\nAreas for further exploration:\nCustomizable parameters: Consider allowing users to adjust the parameters of the fractal drawings, binaural beats, and music to personalize their experience.\nIntegration with other tools: Investigate potential integration with other wellness apps or wearable devices to offer a more holistic approach to mental", "short_description": "Experience the transformative power of VR meditation with PsydMind, your personal gateway to inner peace and well-being.\nCombining the five categories of scenes (anxiety, stress, ADHD, insomnia, and depression) with design principles like fractal drawing using generative art sounds like a powerful and creative approach. Objects moving with binaural beats and music further enhances the immersive and therapeutic experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_p